{"name":"Aster","hex":"#867ba9","fetched":"2026-11-01","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Aster","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A taxonomic genus within the family Asteraceae – asters."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A unisex given name from Latin."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Aster"}],"entries":[{"title":"Aster (genus)","blocks":[{"text":"Aster is a genus of perennial flowering plants in the family Asteraceae. Its circumscription has been narrowed, and it now encompasses around 170 species, all but one of which are restricted to Eurasia; many species formerly in Aster are now in other genera of the tribe Astereae. Aster amellus is the type species of the genus and the family Asteraceae."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Asteraceae_-_Aster_amellus.JPG/330px-Asteraceae_-_Aster_amellus.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aster_(genus)","wikidata":"Q517130"},{"title":"List of Aster synonyms","blocks":[{"text":"The genus Aster is now generally restricted to the Old World species. The other species have now been reclassified as Afroaster, Almutaster, Canadanthus, Doellingeria, Eucephalus, Eurybia, Ionactis, Oligoneuron, Oreostemma, Sericocarpus and Symphyotrichum."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Aster_synonyms","wikidata":"Q6562497"},{"title":"Aster (missile family)","blocks":[{"text":"The Aster 15 and Aster 30 are a Franco-Italian family of all-weather, vertical launch surface-to-air missiles. The name \"Aster\" stands for \"Aérospatiale Terminale\", with French company Aérospatiale having been the project's lead contractor before its missile activities were merged into MBDA. It also takes inspiration from the word \"aster\", meaning \"star\" in Ancient Greek. The missiles as well as the related weapon systems are manufactured by Eurosam, a consortium consisting of MBDA France, MBDA Italy and Thales, each holding a 33.3% share."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/MBDA_Aster_p1220947.jpg/330px-MBDA_Aster_p1220947.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aster_(missile_family)","wikidata":"Q747354"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Asteraceae_-_Aster_amellus.JPG/500px-Asteraceae_-_Aster_amellus.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Asteraceae_-_Aster_amellus.JPG/500px-Asteraceae_-_Aster_amellus.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAsteraceae_-_Aster_amellus.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Aster_flower.jpg/500px-Aster_flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Aster_flower.jpg/1280px-Aster_flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Aster_flower.jpg/500px-Aster_flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Multi layer petals Aster flower","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAster_flower.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Bloeiwijze_van_een_herfstaster_%28Aster%29._02-10-2026._%28d.j.b%29_01.jpg/500px-Bloeiwijze_van_een_herfstaster_%28Aster%29._02-10-2026._%28d.j.b%29_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Bloeiwijze_van_een_herfstaster_%28Aster%29._02-10-2026._%28d.j.b%29_01.jpg/1280px-Bloeiwijze_van_een_herfstaster_%28Aster%29._02-10-2026._%28d.j.b%29_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_camp